  Leg 2 — ship. Included by taskdef/release/instructions.txt under its
  "## Leg 2 — ship" heading, so this body starts at H3. The four release
  parameters (release.github_target, release.tag_prefix, release.signing_key,
  release.changelog) were resolved in Phase 0.5; leg 2 consumes the first
  three. Step names extend the derived-step vocabulary of the resume
